@page "/report"

<h3 class="mb-4 fw-bold text-primary">📊 Reports Dashboard</h3>

<div class="container">
    <div class="row g-4">

        <!-- InStock Report -->
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <Card class="shadow-lg border-0 rounded-4 h-100">
                <CardBody class="p-4">
                    <h5 class="fw-bold text-success">📦 InStock Report</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted mt-3">
                        The Instock Report provides a structured view of all inward inventory transactions,
                        helping you track what stock has entered the system over any selected period.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-muted">
                        With powerful filters like date range, supplier, category, inward number, batch number,
                        and quantity ranges, you can analyze data with precision.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-muted">
                        Summary insights include total inward quantity, unique products, supplier distribution
                        and overall stock value.
                    </p>

                    <div class="d-grid mt-3">
                        <NavLink href="/reports/instock">
                            <Button Color="ButtonColor.Success" Size="ButtonSize.Small" class="rounded-pill fw-bold shadow-sm">
                                <Icon Name="IconName.BoxSeam" /> InStock Report
                            </Button>
                        </NavLink>
                    </div>
                </CardBody>
            </Card>
        </div>

        <!-- Outward Report -->
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <Card class="shadow-lg border-0 rounded-4 h-100">
                <CardBody class="p-4">
                    <h5 class="fw-bold text-secondary">📤 Outward Report</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted mt-3">
                        The Outward Report offers a complete view of all inventory items that have moved out
                        of the organization, making it easier to track dispatched products.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-muted">
                        Users can apply advanced filters like date range, supplier, category, 
                        batch number, sorting & grouping options.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-muted">
                        It shows summary metrics including total dispatched quantity, unique products,
                        supplier distribution and financial value calculations.
                    </p>

                    <div class="d-grid mt-3">
                        <NavLink href="/reports/outward">
                            <Button Color="ButtonColor.Secondary" Size="ButtonSize.Small" class="rounded-pill fw-bold shadow-sm">
                                <Icon Name="IconName.CartDash" /> Outward Report
                            </Button>
                        </NavLink>
                    </div>
                </CardBody>
            </Card>
        </div>

        <!-- Sale Return Report -->
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <Card class="shadow-lg border-0 rounded-4 h-100">
                <CardBody class="p-4">
                    <h5 class="fw-bold text-primary">↩️ Sale Return Report</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted mt-3">
                        The Sale Return Report provides detailed insights into returned sales transactions,
                        helping businesses understand return reasons and inventory impact.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-muted">
                        It supports advanced filtering such as date range, supplier, category, return number,
                        sorting options, and page size adjustments.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-muted">
                        Summary cards highlight total return quantity, number of transactions, and product-level
                        return trends.
                    </p>

                    <div class="d-grid mt-3">
                        <NavLink href="/reports/sale-return">
                            <Button Color="ButtonColor.Primary" Size="ButtonSize.Small" class="rounded-pill fw-bold shadow-sm">
                                <Icon Name="IconName.GraphUp" /> Sale Return Report
                            </Button>
                        </NavLink>
                    </div>
                </CardBody>
            </Card>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>
